Scoped EPX pixel-art scaler

The n option, the output geometry (w*n by h*n), the packed RGBA pixel-format list
and the epx2/epx3 neighbour-equality rules with edge clamping in src/video-epx.ts
and src/video-ops/epx.ts follow libavfilter/vf_epx.c (epx_options, epx2_slice,
epx3_slice, config_output, pix_fmts, filter_frame).
Fixed FFmpeg commit:946fcce07b6dcd0331c8cc609192aeff5e1924f8
